          "type": "text",
          "props": {
            "content": "I worked on key gameplay features.<br><br><strong>Parring</strong>: players can right click and do parring. I ensured this mechanic is network accurate and server authoritative by extending the lagCompensation component.<br><br><strong>Popsicles</strong>: Players can turn into popsicles when thrown into oven.<br><br>And so much more!",
